# Business lens

Before planning or shipping on lotto-predictore, read **`.cursor/business-lens.md`** (also `project.business_lens` in `.cursor/project.yaml`).

**Primary:** prove the app **actually improves lottery chances** enough that **investing money** (tickets, time, tooling) is rational — walk-forward, real settlement, official prizes, honest baselines.

**Secondary:** **הכנסה נוספת משימוש בזה** — additional revenue from using the product, only after measurement is trustworthy.

If a task does not move primary proof or secondary revenue, do not implement it — record it instead.
